  (text "MUTE=1 (0/+9V logic) selects NO: OUT is clamped to VREF and IN is isolated (off isolation -70 dB at 1 MHz, far better at audio). MUTE=0 passes IN via NC (Ron ~5 ohm, break-before-make ~30 ns)." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 20.32 24.13 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "23426e71-579b-50a4-84cf-5a9ba2cc1fea"))
  (text "No DC across the switch: IN comes from a VREF-referenced stage with unity DC gain and the OUT load returns to VREF, so the switching step is only the op-amp Vos (a few mV, -48 dBV) -- no pop." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 20.32 26.67 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "f8b52e84-3888-5dd9-9984-f1ab0c53bcc7"))
  (text "Control input: VIH guaranteed 2.4 V (10 V supply) / 5 V (12 V supply), ~1.5 V typ; every MUTE source in this design sits >= 6 V loaded. IIN 0.1 uA max: R214 1M holds MUTE low with no source active and keeps the power-on hold light." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 20.32 29.21 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "12ffb73c-8d3b-5d82-a717-99a7a8af378e"))
  (text "NC = signal, NO = VREF, COM = OUT" (exclude_from_sim no) (at 60.96 60.96 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "dcf8f7c9-8915-520c-9689-73a21ef805e8"))
  (text "V- to GND (single supply); thermal pad to GND or floating." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 96.52 78.74 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "585cddab-f343-51bc-95ad-de380bb962a2"))
